ion PIN mailers).\n10. INVESTMENTS: Wealth management, trading, and automated investments. (Keywords: Stocks, ETFs, Mutual Funds, AutoInvest, portfolios, trading fees).\n\n    \n    Recent Conversation Context: Long-Term Conversation Context (advisory only):\nupdated compact memory\n\nCurrent Session (latest 10 turns):\nAI: I’m sorry, but I can only help with banking‑related topics. If you have any questions about our banking services, such as Instant Loans or Horizon savings accounts, please let me know!\nUser: have you watched stargate\nAI: I’m sorry, but I can only help with banking‑related topics. If you have any questions about our banking services, such as Instant Loans or Horizon savings accounts, please let me know!\nUser: what can you do generally\nAI: I’m a virtual assistant that can help with banking‑related topics such as Instant Loans or Horizon savings accounts. I’m not able to discuss other subjects. Do you have a banking question I can assist you with?\nUser: list what user journey you can help\nAI: I can guide you through the Instant Loan journey or the Horizon savings‑account journey. Which one would you like to explore?\nUser: how many products do you have\nAI: We currently offer two banking products: the Instant Loan and the Horizon savings account. Which one would you like more information on?\nUser: what about credit card?\nAI: Here’s everything you need to know about Horizon Bank credit cards:\n\n**Documentation to start your application** – Singapore citizens and permanent residents can use MyInfo for a fast‑track form. Foreign applicants must have a passport and their most recent payslip ready to upload or capture via the Horizon App (MyInfo can also be used if available).\n\n**What happens after you submit the application** – You’ll get an immediate decision notification by email or SMS. If approved, the message will include instructions to log into the Horizon App and activate your new card. If declined, you’ll receive an email or text with the outcome. If a decision can’t be made instantly or additional documents are needed, we’ll email you with directions to review the pending status in the app and upload the required files.\n\n**Eligibility requirements** – • Singapore citizen or permanent resident, age 21‑55, annual income at least S$30,000. • Foreigners with a valid work pass, annual income S$60,000. • If you are over 55 years old, the income thresholds are S$15,000 for Singapore citizens/PRs and S$60,000 for foreigners with a work pass.\n\n**Key benefits and features** – • Highest reward points on FairPrice Group grocery and food spend. • No annual fee, no foreign‑currency surcharge, no over‑limit penalties. • Choose your due‑date and repay at your convenience. • Built‑in 3‑D Secure for online purchases. • Instant lock/unlock and payment‑preference controls in the app. • Pair with your Horizon debit card to switch between credit and savings accounts. • Immediate virtual card issuance for online and contact‑less payments (Apple Pay/Google Pay). • One‑tap NFC activation by tapping the back of your phone to the card. • Real‑time rewards tracking, spending insights, and a spend‑monitoring tool. • Set a six‑digit PIN in the app; card number is hidden (numberless card). • Eco‑friendly card made from recycled ocean plastic with a recycled‑paper welcome pack.\nUser: how apply\nAI: To start your Horizon Bank credit‑card application, simply open a partner’s mobile app or website and select the credit‑card request option. This will forward you to Horizon’s secure web portal where you can use MyInfo to auto‑populate your personal details. Have your passport and most recent payslip ready (if you’re a foreign applicant) or ensure MyInfo is linked (if you’re a Singapore citizen or permanent resident). Once you submit, you’ll receive an immediate status update and any further actions will be prompted in the Horizon App.\nUser: I've completed this step, continue.\nAI: To proceed, please use the MyInfo service on the secure Horizon Bank web portal. MyInfo will automatically fill in your personal details, saving you time. Ensure your MyInfo account is linked and you grant consent, then continue with the application.\nUser: I've completed this step, continue.\nAI: To move forward, please upload a clear photo or scan of your passport and your most recent payslip using the Horizon App. Open the app, go to the credit‑card application section, tap “Upload documents”, and select the passport and payslip files. Ensure the images are legible; the system will confirm once the upload is successful. After the upload is verified, we can proceed to the next part of your application.\nUser: I've completed this step, continue.\nAI: As a retiree, the next step is to upload your CPF LIFE payout transaction records for the past two months. To do this, log into the My CPF portal, go to **My dashboards → Retirement → Monthly payouts → Monthly payout history**, and download or screenshot the transaction records. Then open the Horizon App, navigate to the credit‑card application section, and use the “Upload documents” feature to submit those CPF LIFE records. Make sure you have identified yourself as a retiree in the application before uploading. Once the upload is successful, we can move on to the following step.\nUser: I've completed all the steps.\n    User Baseline (advisory only; do not treat it as a current request): Customer is interested in Instant Loan and Horizon savings account. For Instant Loan, eligibility requires age, Singapore residency/citizenship, and annual income; these details have not been provided yet. Next step: provide age, residency status, and income. For Horizon savings account, requires MyInfo verification and confirmation of Singapore residency; phone lacks MyInfo permission and a compliance block remains unresolved, needing manual approval or completion of MyInfo verification in the Horizon app.\n    Latest User Input: \"I've completed all the steps.\"\n    \n    TASK: Triage the user input based on the stage of their journey.\n    1. ESCALATION: User explicitly demands a human agent or manager.\n    2. CLARIFICATION: The input is PURELY chitchat, greetings, or completely unrelated to banking (e.g., \"Hello\", \"How are you\", \"What is the weather\"). \n    3. VALID_JOURNEY: A valid query mapping to one of the 10 Journeys above.\n    \n    If VALID_JOURNEY, output an ordered array of target_journeys (primary first).\n    \n    Output JSON ONLY:\n    {\"triage_status\": \"ESCALATION\" | \"CLARIFICATION\" | \"VALID_JOURNEY\", \"target_journeys\": [\"JOURNEY_1\"]}\n    "}
