{"timestamp": "2026-08-13T11:31:51.793+00:00", "event": "llm.request", "session_id": "sess_9cee85fc-ea74-414a-8899-6a8c5a25678e", "user_id": "USR_999", "model_id": "gemini-3.5-flash-lite", "raw_prompt": "\n    ROLE ALIGNMENT:\n    You are an impartial, read-only Horizon Bank UI routing agent. You do NOT give financial advice, and you CANNOT make product choices for the user. \n    \n    USER JOURNEY GUIDELINES (UI Sandbox):\n    \n1. ACCOUNT_OPENING: Users attempting to establish a new banking relationship or open a new account type. (Keywords: Eligibility, required documents like NRIC/Singpass, application status tracking).\n2. DEPOSIT_ACCOUNTS: Managing active cash deposits, interest earnings, and daily operations. (Keywords: Interest yields, balances, Savings Pots, account restrictions/fees, reactivating dormant accounts).\n3. DEBIT_CARDS: Lifecycle and security of everyday spending debit cards. (Keywords: Activation, checkout declines, reporting lost cards, PIN management).\n4. CREDIT_CARDS: Applying for, managing, or disputing charges on personal credit lines. (Keywords: Annual fee waivers, checking limits, transaction declines, chargebacks, disputes).\n5. DIGITAL_BANKING: App access, login authentication, and credential safety. (Keywords: Password/passcode reset, biometric lockouts, delayed OTPs, security token issues).\n6. STATEMENTS: Obtaining or understanding monthly banking statements. (Keywords: PDF downloads, missing statements, explaining confusing merchant names).\n7. LOANS: Seeking personal lending, credit conversions, or cash liquidity. (Keywords: Loan features, EIR, application status, missed payments, late penalties).\n8. BRANCHES: Locating physical bank touchpoints and automated teller machines. (Keywords: Branch/ATM locator, opening hours, checking service availability like cash deposit or card printing).\n9. PROFILE: Authenticated customers managing personal records. (Keywords: Updating registered mobile/email/address, tracking address verification PIN mailers).\n10. INVESTMENTS: Wealth management, trading, and automated investments. (Keywords: Stocks, ETFs, Mutual Funds, AutoInvest, portfolios, trading fees).\n\n    \n    Recent Conversation Context: Long-Term Conversation Context (advisory only):\nupdated compact memory\n\nCurrent Session (latest 10 turns):\nAI: I’m sorry, but I can only help with banking‑related topics. If you have any questions about our banking services, such as Instant Loans or Horizon savings accounts, please let me know!\nUser: what can you do generally\nAI: I’m a virtual assistant that can help with banking‑related topics such as Instant Loans or Horizon savings accounts. I’m not able to discuss other subjects. Do you have a banking question I can assist you with?\nUser: list what user journey you can help\nAI: I can guide you through the Instant Loan journey or the Horizon savings‑account journey. Which one would you like to explore?\nUser: how many products do you have\nAI: We currently offer two banking products: the Instant Loan and the Horizon savings account. Which one would you like more information on?\nUser: what about credit card?\nAI: Here’s everything you need to know about Horizon Bank credit cards:\n\n**Documentation to start your application** – Singapore citizens and permanent residents can use MyInfo for a fast‑track form. Foreign applicants must have a passport and their most recent payslip ready to upload or capture via the Horizon App (MyInfo can also be used if available).\n\n**What happens after you submit the application** – You’ll get an immediate decision notification by email or SMS. If approved, the message will include instructions to log into the Horizon App and activate your new card. If declined, you’ll receive an email or text with the outcome. If a decision can’t be made instantly or additional documents are needed, we’ll email you with directions to review the pending status in the app and upload the required files.\n\n**Eligibility requirements**