ermitted from abroad.\nUser: gugugaga\nAI: I’m sorry, but I can only assist with Horizon banking questions. If you have any queries about opening an account, eligibility, or other banking matters, please let me know.\n\nCould you tell me what banking question you have?\nUser: i want to apply for a loan and also i lost my credit card\n        Task Inputs: [{\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_1\", \"procedural\": \"application process, submit documents, Horizon App, online form\", \"policy\": \"eligibility requirements, age limits, income criteria, residency rules\", \"conceptual\": \"personal loan, credit facility, financing\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Personal_Loan\", \"target_intent\": [\"Application\", \"Eligibility\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_f9cce3c1\", \"content\": \"Question: If my Instant Loan request is declined, can I still submit applications for other Horizon Bank products such as a credit card or a savings account?\\n\\nAnswer: - Absolutely. A declined loan does not prevent you from applying for other Horizon Bank offerings. You simply need to start a new application tailored to the specific product you wish to obtain.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_0ae0bb51\", \"content\": \"Question: Do I qualify for Horizon Bank’s Instant Loan offering?\\n\\nAnswer: - **For current Horizon Bank clients:**\\n  * You need to possess a Horizon credit card and have adequate unused credit limit.\\n- **For new applicants:**\\n  * Singapore citizens, permanent residents, and foreign nationals are all permitted to apply for the Instant Loan.\\n  * Every submission will be subject to Horizon Bank’s credit‑worthiness assessment.\\n\\nYou may request a credit facility provided you satisfy the following criteria:\\n- You are aged between {{faq_0ae0bb51_001}} and {{faq_0ae0bb51_002}} years.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_003}} if you are a Singapore citizen or permanent resident.\\n- Your annual income is at least {{faq_0ae0bb51_004}} if you are a foreigner holding a valid work pass.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_75ed6e4d\", \"content\": \"Question: What is the typical timeframe for my loan to be approved?\\n\\nAnswer: - The vast majority of loans are approved and the amount is deposited into your Horizon savings account in about {{faq_75ed6e4d_001}} seconds.\"}]}, {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"task\": {\"task_id\": \"task_2\", \"procedural\": \"report lost card, block card, replacement request, customer service\", \"policy\": \"security procedures, liability limits, replacement fees\", \"conceptual\": \"stolen credit card, card logistics, security block\", \"target_commercial_product\": \"Credit_Card\", \"target_intent\": [\"Card Logistics\", \"Authentication And Security\"]}, \"parents\": [{\"parent_id\": \"faq_7883a8c2\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card is missing—what steps should I take?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you cannot locate your Horizon card, you can temporarily freeze it through the Horizon App:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_001}}. Sign in to the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_002}}. On the card overview screen, tap \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_003}}. Select \\\"Freeze Card.\\\"\\n- For a card that is lost or stolen, first freeze it and then request a replacement:\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_004}}. Log into the Horizon App.\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_005}}. Open the card dashboard and choose \\\"View & Manage Card.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_006}}. Tap \\\"Freeze Card\\\" followed by \\\"Order Replacement.\\\"\\n  {{faq_7883a8c2_007}}. Horizon will issue a new card and permanently deactivate the old one.\\n- You may also wish to file a police report.\\n- The new card will arrive with a different card number; be sure to update any recurring payments (e.g., subscriptions) with the new details.\\n- For additional assistance, select \\\"Contact Us\\\" from the app menu.\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_bfe32bf8\", \"content\": \"Question: What actions should I take if I suspect fraudulent or suspicious activity on my account?\\n\\nAnswer: - If you believe you have been targeted by fraud, immediately freeze your Horizon card and reach out to us without delay. We also recommend filing a report with local law enforcement. You can lock your card through the Horizon App: from the home screen select \\\"View and Manage card\\\" and then choose \\\"Lock card\\\". For any additional inquiries, contact us via the voice call or live‑chat feature in the Horizon App, or call our hotline at +{{faq_bfe32bf8_001}} {{faq_bfe32bf8_002}}-HORIZON ( +{{faq_bfe32bf8_003}} {{faq_bfe32bf8_004}} {{faq_bfe32bf8_005}} ).\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_33f045af\", \"content\": \"Question: My Horizon card has been compromised due to physical damage. What steps should I take to obtain a new one from Horizon Bank?\\n\\nAnswer: To acquire a replacement card, follow these straightforward steps: \\n    * Access your Horizon App account \\n    * Navigate to the 'Card Management' section \\n    * Choose the 'Replace Current Card' option \\n    * Indicate that your card is damaged to complete the request\"}, {\"parent_id\": \"faq_ed9b5ce2\", \"content\": \"Question: What measures does Horizon Bank take to protect me from phishing scams and unauthorized transactions?\\n\\nAnswer: At Horizon Bank, we prioritize your security and adhere to the guidelines outlined in Section {{faq_ed9b5ce2_001}} of the E-Payments User Protection Guidelines. As part of our commitment to the Shared Responsibility Framework, we have implemented several key measures to safeguard your accounts. These include: \\n   - A mandatory {{faq_ed9b5ce2_002}}-hour waiting period after activating your Horizon Key or logging in from a new device, during which certain high-risk activities such as adding new payees, increasing transaction limits, disabling notifications, or changing your contact information are restricted.\\n   - Immediate notifications: You will receive instant updates via push notifications and email for all outgoing payments, ensuring you are always informed about your transactions.\\n   - Emergency Lockdown: The Horizon App features an Emergency Lockdown option, accessible under Profile > Security, which allows you to instantly block all access to your mobile banking, account, and cards if you suspect they have been compromised.\\n   - Advanced Security Systems: As of {{faq_ed9b5ce2_003}} June {{faq_ed9b5ce2_004}}, we have enhanced our systems to provide an additional layer of protection against potential phishing scams. Some transactions may be temporarily paused for review, and you will be notified to verify the transaction. If you do not recognize the transaction, please cancel it within the {{faq_ed9b5ce2_005}}-hour timeframe provided.\\n   - Round-the-Clock Support: Our customer service is available {{faq_ed9b5ce2_006}}/{{faq_ed9b5ce2_007}}. You can reach us through the Horizon App or by calling our dedicated hotline at +{{faq_ed9b5ce2_008}} {{faq_ed9b5ce2_009}} {{faq_ed9b5ce2_010}} for immediate assistance.\"}]}]\n\n        Rules:\n        - Return one result for every supplied task_id.\n        - For SUFFICIENT, return only parent IDs from that exact task that are directly relevant. At least one approved ID is required.\n        - For RETRY, return no approved IDs and concise query-refinement feedback. The backend determines terminal UNAVAILABLE status after three failed attempts.\n        - Treat {placeholders} in parent content as valid approved facts.\n        - Never invent a parent ID, fact, or instruction.\n\n        Output JSON only: {\"task_results\": [{\"task_id\": \"...\", \"status\": \"SUFFICIENT\" | \"RETRY\" | \"UNAVAILABLE\", \"approved_parent_ids\": [\"...\"], \"reason\": \"...\", \"search_feedback\": \"...\"}]}\n        "}
